    <string name="guide">GUIDE</string>
    <string name="guide_title">HOW TO USE S NOTES</string>
    <string name="guide_body">• PEN — write or draw freely on the page.\n\n• ERASER — remove part of your drawing.\n\n• LASER — draw a temporary pointer that fades away smoothly.\n\n• SHAPES — choose a shape, then drag in any direction to draw it.\n\n• SELECT — tap an object or drag around an area to select, move, resize, rotate, or delete it.\n\n• TEXT — tap the page to add text and edit it later with Select.\n\n• IMAGE — insert an image and resize, rotate, move, or edit it.\n\n• PAGE — the page extends automatically as you continue writing.\n\n• RESET ZOOM — reset the zoom while keeping your current page position.\n\n• SHARE / EXPORT — save or share your note as PDF, JPG, or PNG.\n\n• HOME — rename, select, export, restore, or delete notes from the home page.</string>
